  "title": "Essential Utilities to Report Financial Results for Q2 2026",
  "summary": "BRYN MAWR, Pa. --(BUSINESS WIRE)--Jul. 16, 2026-- Essential Utilities (NYSE: WTRG) expects to report earnings for quarter ended June 30, 2026, following market close on August 4, 2026. The company’s conference call with financial analysts will take place on August 5, 2026, at 11 a.m. Eastern Time.",
